amueller/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amueller/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2012-09-18T18:57:15Z","updated_at":"2012-09-18T18:57:44Z","body":"I think we just need to make the token-pattern unicode:\n``re.findall(ur'(?u)\\b\\w\\w+\\b', \"теперь никто не сможет обвинить вас в плагиате, ибо каждый текст яндекс.рефератов неповторим.\")`\n\nreturns the words. The important part is `(u?)`.\n\nShould I change that in master?\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/issues/comments/8666003/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"amueller","id":449558,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0OTU1OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/449558?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amueller","html_url":"https://github.com/amueller","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amueller/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amueller/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amueller/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amueller/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amueller/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amueller/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amueller/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amueller/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amueller/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/issues/comments/8668383","html_url":"https://github.com/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/issues/1098#issuecomment-8668383","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/issues/1098","id":8668383,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDg2NjgzODM=","user":{"login":"ogrisel","id":89061,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MDYx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89061?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogrisel","html_url":"https://github.com/ogrisel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogrisel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogrisel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogrisel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogrisel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogrisel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogrisel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogrisel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogrisel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogrisel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2012-09-18T20:07:13Z","updated_at":"2012-09-18T20:08:10Z","body":"You need to put the `u` for the russian string literal to make it work correctly under python 2.7:\n\n```\n>>> text = u\"теперь никто не сможет обвинить вас в плагиате, ибо каждый текст яндекс.рефератов неповторим.\"\n>>> for w in re.findall(ur'(?u)\\b\\w\\w+\\b', text): print w\nтеперь\nникто\nне\nсможет\nобвинить\nвас\nплагиате\nибо\nкаждый\nтекст\nяндекс\nрефератов\nнеповторим\n\"\"\"\n```\n\n+1 for fixing the default in scikit-learn but this would require adding a new test to make sure that the whole analyser tool chain works as expected. Also a quick check by timing on the CountVectorizer on twenty newsgroups with and without this change to make sure we don't introduce a big slowdown with this new default.\n\nBTW: when I translate this sentence with google I get:\n\n\"\"\"\nNow no one can accuse you of plagiarism, for each text yandeks.referatov unique.\n\"\"\"\n\nI would rather use some text from the russian wikipedia to avoid copy right issue, for instance the first sentence of this page: http://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%9C%D0%B0%D1%88%D0%B8%D0%BD%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B5_%D0%BE%D0%B1%D1%83%D1%87%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/issues/comments/8668383/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ogrisel","id":89061,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MDYx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89061?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogrisel","html_url":"https://github.com/ogrisel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogrisel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogrisel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogrisel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogrisel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogrisel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogrisel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogrisel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogrisel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogrisel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/issues/comments/8685019","html_url":"https://github.com/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/issues/1098#issuecomment-8685019","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/issues/1098","id":8685019,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDg2ODUwMTk=","user":{"login":"amueller","id":449558,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0OTU1OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/449558?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amueller","html_url":"https://github.com/amueller